    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting (Bleeding Hand)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You may spend a standard, move, or swift action to discard a card from your hand and increase your initiative count by 3 for the rest of the encounter. This effect is cumulative over multiple uses of this ability.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
